<title>UK: Sullom Voe oil liftings fall, only one cargo to U..</title>
<headline>Sullom Voe oil liftings fall, only one cargo to U..</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Loadings of Brent crude from Britain's Sullom Voe terminal totalled 696,430 tonnes in the week to December 17, down from the previous week's 741,647 tonnes, the Shetlands Islands Council Marine Operations said.</p>
<p>All but one of the shipments were to European destinations.</p>
<p>One cargo of Brent sailed for the U.S.</p>
